      "message": "This is already part of ec_params_thermal_set_threshold_v1 with uint32_t\u0027s. We probably shouldn\u0027t change it since it would break some existing implementations.\n\nWhat we can do instead is change our internal implementation to use more appropriate types. Eg. don\u0027t use ec_thermal_config (except in our handler for ec_params_thermal_set_threshold_v1), instead use a new struct with appropriately sized variables.",
